Portions of this project are adapted from OpenCV
(https://github.com/opencv/opencv), specifically the ORB implementation in
modules/features2d/src/orb.cpp:

  - orb_core.cpp / orb_core.hpp: HarrisResponses, ICAngles, and
    computeOrbDescriptors are direct ports of the equivalent OpenCV
    functions (adapted to this project's own Image8U/KeyPoint/Point2i
    types in place of cv::Mat/cv::KeyPoint/cv::Point).
  - fast_detector.cpp / fast_detector.hpp: FAST-9 corner detection,
    adapted from OpenCV's FAST feature detector.
  - orb_pattern.hpp: the 256-quad BRIEF sampling pattern (bit_pattern_31_)
    is reproduced verbatim from OpenCV's table.
  - orb.cpp / orb.hpp: the overall detectAndCompute pipeline structure
    (pyramid construction, per-level feature budget, angle/descriptor
    orchestration) follows OpenCV's ORB_Impl::detectAndCompute.

